[00:00.000] 编曲 : Michael Jackson
[00:01.000] 制作人 : Quincy Jones/Michael Jackson
[00:02.000] 作词 : Michael Jackson
[00:03.000] 作曲 : Michael Jackson
[00:29.900]She was more like a beauty queen from a movie scene
{"她更像电影里的选美皇后"}
[00:32.832]I said don't mind but what do you mean I am the one
{"我说不介意，但你说我是那个人是什么意思"}
[00:37.893]Who will dance on the floor in the round
{"谁会在舞池中旋转起舞"}
[00:43.538]She said I am the one who will dance on the floor in the round
{"她说我就是那个会在舞池中旋转起舞的人"}
[00:53.503]She told me her name was Billie Jean as she caused a scene
{"她告诉我她叫比莉·琼，同时她引起了一场风波"}
[00:57.696]Then every head turned with eyes that dreamed of being  the one
{"然后每个人都转过头，眼中梦想着成为那个人"}
[01:02.671]Who will dance on the floor in the round
{"谁会在舞池中旋转起舞"}
[01:09.516]People always told me be careful of what you do
{"人们总是告诉我，要小心你的所作所为"}
[01:13.535]And don't go around breaking young girls'hearts
{"不要到处伤害年轻女孩的心"}
[01:17.732]And mother always told me be careful of who you love
{"妈妈总是告诉我，要小心你爱的人"}
[01:21.714]And be careful of what you do 'cause the lie becomes the  truth
{"要小心你的所作所为，因为谎言会变成真相"}
[01:26.310]Billie Jean is not my lover
{"比莉·琼不是我的情人"}
[01:30.356]She's just a girl who claims that I am the one
{"她只是个声称我是那个人的女孩"}
[01:35.542]But the kid is not my son
{"但那孩子不是我的儿子"}
[01:40.846]She says I am the one but the kid is not my son
{"她说我是那个人，但那孩子不是我的儿子"}
[01:50.660]For forty days and for forty nights
{"四十个日夜"}
[01:53.929] law was on her side
{"法律站在她那边"}
[01:55.112]But who can stand when she's in demand
{"但当她被需要时，谁能抵挡"}
[01:58.136]Her schemes and plans
{"她的计谋和计划"}
[02:00.310]'Cause we danced on the floor in the round
{"因为我们在舞池中旋转起舞"}
[02:05.268]So take my strong advice just remember to always think twice
{"所以接受我强烈的建议，记住要三思而行"}
[02:13.846]Do think twice
{"一定要三思"}
[02:14.409]She told my baby we'd danced till three then she looked at me
{"她告诉我的宝贝我们跳舞到三点，然后她看着我"}
[02:19.484]Then showed a photo my baby cried his eyes were like mine
{"然后展示了一张照片，我的宝贝哭了，他的眼睛像我"}
[02:24.789]'Cause we danced on the floor in the round baby
{"因为我们在舞池中旋转起舞，宝贝"}
[02:31.635]People always told me be careful of what you do
{"人们总告诫我　要谨言慎行"}
[02:35.623]And don't go around breaking young girls'hearts
{"别四处游荡　伤透少女心"}
[02:38.707]She came and stood right by me
{"她走近我身旁伫立"}
[02:42.830]Then the smell of sweet perfume
{"甜香气息随即弥漫"}
[02:43.723]This happened much too soon
{"这一切发生得太快"}
[02:45.878]She called me to her room
{"她唤我进入她房间"}
[02:47.973]Billie Jean is not my lover
{"比利·珍不是我的情人"}
[02:52.328]She's just a girl who claims that I am the one
{"她只是个声称我属于她的女孩"}
[02:57.517]But the kid is not my son
{"但那孩子不是我的骨肉"}
